WEBVTT

00:00:02.952 --> 00:00:03.889
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> Part 2

00:00:05.231 --> 00:00:06.629
<v><b>Host:</b></v> OK, Team B.

00:00:06.699 --> 00:00:10.334
You have one minute to ask Team A questions.

00:00:11.208 --> 00:00:13.291
<v><b>George:</b></v> Hmm… let’s start with Nadine.

00:00:13.839 --> 00:00:15.863
Mike’s your hair stylist, right?

00:00:16.498 --> 00:00:19.172
<v><b>Nadine:</b></v> Yes, we’re very good friends.

00:00:19.616 --> 00:00:21.474
<v><b>George:</b></v> What’s the name of his salon?

00:00:22.049 --> 00:00:27.465
<v><b>Nadine:</b></v> Uh, it’s called… uh… Good Hair Day.

00:00:30.483 --> 00:00:31.610
<v><b>Charlie:</b></v> Is Mike married?

00:00:32.087 --> 00:00:34.239
<v><b>Nadine:</b></v> Uh, yes, he is.

00:00:34.771 --> 00:00:36.490
<v><b>Alice:</b></v> Does he have children?

00:00:36.975 --> 00:00:41.455
<v><b>Nadine:</b></v> Uh, yes, uh… no, he doesn’t.

00:00:41.798 --> 00:00:43.951
I don’t think he has children.

00:00:44.882 --> 00:00:47.498
<v><b>Alice:</b></v> OK, so now, Tyler.

00:00:47.525 --> 00:00:50.136
You say Mike’s your dentist.

00:00:50.521 --> 00:00:52.410
Where is his office?

00:00:53.124 --> 00:00:56.933
<v><b>Tyler:</b></v> It’s, uh, downtown, near the shopping mall.

00:00:57.665 --> 00:00:59.243
<v><b>Charlie:</b></v> Are you and Mike friends?

00:00:59.942 --> 00:01:02.878
<v><b>Tyler:</b></v> Well, no, not really friends.

00:01:03.236 --> 00:01:05.602
It’s difficult to be friends with your dentist –

00:01:05.625 --> 00:01:08.197
it’s impossible to have a conversation!

00:01:10.598 --> 00:01:11.808
<v><b>George:</b></v> Is he expensive?

00:01:12.409 --> 00:01:13.314
<v><b>Tyler:</b></v> What do you think?

00:01:13.401 --> 00:01:14.753
He’s a dentist!

00:01:16.602 --> 00:01:18.396
<v><b>George:</b></v> OK, James now.

00:01:19.076 --> 00:01:21.876
You say Mike’s a chef in a restaurant.

00:01:22.392 --> 00:01:24.063
What’s the name of the restaurant?

00:01:24.809 --> 00:01:27.100
<v><b>James:</b></v> The Red Lion.

00:01:27.330 --> 00:01:29.243
It’s a great restaurant.

00:01:30.234 --> 00:01:32.085
<v><b>Charlie:</b></v> What food does Mike cook?

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:36.089
<v><b>James:</b></v> Uh, great French food!

00:01:36.581 --> 00:01:41.085
French onion soup, steak frites, things like that.

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:45.084
And he makes good crepes.

00:01:45.652 --> 00:01:47.234
<v><b>Alice:</b></v> What’s his specialty?

00:01:47.804 --> 00:01:50.788
<v><b>James:</b></v> Uh, spaghetti carbonara.

00:01:53.651 --> 00:01:54.683
<v><b>Host:</b></v> OK, team.

00:01:55.048 --> 00:01:56.254
Your time’s up.